  "description": "The beautiful sledgehammer. Seek, destroy, love, embrace. Do whatever. This bike can handle it.\nReynolds 725 tubing, fully-sleeved internal cable routing. Compatible with 120mm-150mm travel forks, this frame has room for 29x2.6 (bigger with the dropout to the back) and also works great with mullet wheels. All of our frames feature sliding dropouts for worshipping the one true gear (or optimizing your geometry based on your fork travel while keeping your gears). You can even use angle-adjusting headsets to tweak the geometry to suit your ride style.\nRoll your own and make it any bike you want it to be!\nBoost 148 spacing, 73mm threaded BB, ZS44 upper/ZS56 lower headset compatibility, 31.6 seatpost diameter.",
